    "body": "i.e. mainly in old Limited API (but also if vectorcall is manually off).\r\n\r\nOutside the Limited API there are a couple of functions which do this exactly. We should use them on the basis that they'll hopefully pick the fastest path.\r\n\r\nInside the Limited API we should prefer CallMethodObjArgs on the basis that it avoids vectorcall, or instantiating the bound method, and so is better than doing it outselves manually.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-26T05:09:07Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
